    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/takt/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "Takt gives clubs, artists and organizations a distinctive home on the web. This free WordPress block theme combines generous image layouts, clear typography and balanced spacing with the flexibility of the native Site Editor. Make it yours with seven header layouts, four footer layouts, reusable page patterns and coordinated light and dark styles. Guide visitors with responsive panel menus, optional transparent or glass headers and editable footer columns. Dedicated WooCommerce templates carry the design through your shop, product pages, cart and checkout. Takt is translation-ready, uses system fonts and works without a page builder, license key or required plugin."
    },
